* text=auto eol=lf

# The self-hosted fonts. `* text=auto` above already leaves them alone — git's
# heuristic sees the NUL bytes and declines to convert — but a heuristic is a
# poor guard for the one class of file where being wrong is silent: an eol=lf
# rewrite of a woff2 produces a file that is still committed, still checked out,
# and no longer a font. Say it explicitly.
*.woff2 binary

*.blade.php diff=html
*.css diff=css
*.html diff=html
*.md diff=markdown
*.php diff=php

/.github export-ignore
CHANGELOG.md export-ignore
.styleci.yml export-ignore
